sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Writer thread
  participant M as Shared memory
  participant R as Reader thread
  W->>M: config = new Config(...)  (plain writes)
  W->>M: ready = true  (volatile write)
  Note over W,M: Everything W wrote before the volatile write…
  R->>M: if (ready)  (volatile read sees true)
  Note over M,R: …is guaranteed visible after the volatile read
  R->>M: use config  (sees the fully built object)
